msgstr "*Figura 1. Cifrado de clave asimétrica*\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "AKC offers several useful functions, such as:\n"
msgstr "La AKC ofrece varias funciones útiles, como:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Encryption and decryption** to enable **confidentiality** of "
"communications.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Cifrado y descifrado** para garantizar la **confidencialidad** de las "
"comunicaciones.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Digital signatures** to ensure **authenticity**, **integrity**, and **non-"
"repudiation**.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Firmas digitales** para asegurar la **autenticidad**, la **integridad** y "
"la **no-repudiación**.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Secure key exchange** to facilitate subsequent use of symmetric "
"cryptosystems.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Intercambio seguro de claves** para facilitar el uso posterior de "
"criptosistemas simétricos.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In modern applications, AKC is primarily used for digital signatures and "
"secure key exchange. In this lesson, we introduce these two key functions, "
"and then we discuss several variations of cryptographic protocols for these "
"functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"En las aplicaciones modernas, la AKC se utiliza principalmente para firmas "
"digitales e intercambio seguro de claves. En esta lección presentamos estas "
"dos funciones clave y luego analizamos diversas variantes de protocolos "
"criptográficos para estas funciones.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Key exchange with asymmetric key cryptography {#key-exchange-with-"
"asymmetric-key-cryptography}"
msgstr ""
"Intercambio de claves con criptografía de clave asimétrica {#key-exchange-"
"with-asymmetric-key-cryptography}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One of the fundamental problems in cryptography is securely [exchanging "
"keys](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Key_exchange&oldid=1134576107)."
" For example, if two parties want to use symmetric encryption, both parties "
"need the same key to encrypt and decrypt messages. But how do they securely "
"exchange the key? Asymmetric key cryptography addresses this through "
"interactive and non-interactive key exchange mechanisms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Uno de los problemas fundamentales en criptografía es el [intercambio de "
"claves](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Key_exchange&oldid=1134576107)"
" de forma segura. Por ejemplo, si dos partes quieren usar cifrado simétrico,"
" ambas necesitan la misma clave para cifrar y descifrar mensajes. ¿Pero cómo"
" intercambian esa clave de forma segura? La criptografía de clave asimétrica"
" aborda esto mediante mecanismos de intercambio de claves interactivos y no "
"interactivos.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Interactive key exchange {#interactive-key-exchange}"
msgstr "Intercambio de claves interactivo {#interactive-key-exchange}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An interactive *key exchange protocol* refers to a method where two parties "
"collaborate to create a *shared secret* key over an insecure communication "
"channel. This shared secret key can then be used for symmetric encryption "
"and decryption tasks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Un *protocolo de intercambio de claves* interactivo es un método en el que "
"dos partes colaboran para crear una clave *secreta compartida* a través de "
"un canal de comunicación inseguro. Esta clave secreta compartida puede "
"usarse después para tareas de cifrado y descifrado simétrico.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most well known among such protocols is the [Diffie-Hellman "
"algorithm](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman_key_exchange&oldid=1163912552)"
" (DH), which was devised specifically to facilitate key exchange. In this "
"protocol, each party generates a pair of keys (public and private) and "
"broadcasts their public key. Then each party uses their own private key and "
"the other party's public key to generate a shared secret key. DH employs the"
" principles of modular arithmetic to ensure both parties end up with the "
"same shared secret even though each party has access only to the other "
"party's public key.\n"
msgstr ""
"El más conocido de estos protocolos es el [algoritmo Diffie-"
"Hellman](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman_key_exchange&oldid=1163912552)"
" (DH), diseñado específicamente para facilitar el intercambio de claves. En "
"este protocolo, cada parte genera un par de claves (pública y privada) y "
"difunde su clave pública. Luego, cada parte usa su propia clave privada y la"
" clave pública de la otra parte para generar una clave secreta compartida. "
"DH emplea los principios de la aritmética modular para asegurar que ambas "
"partes obtengan el mismo secreto compartido, aunque cada parte solo tenga "
"acceso a la clave pública de la otra.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modern cryptosystems based on [elliptic curve "
"cryptography](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_cryptography&oldid=1160709993) (ECC) extend this concept with the "
"[elliptic curve Diffie-"
"Hellman)](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman&oldid=1160050860) (ECDH) key exchange. ECDH "
"works similarly to DH but utilizes the properties of elliptic curves, "
"resulting in a more secure and efficient system.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los criptosistemas modernos basados en [criptografía de curva "
"elíptica](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_cryptography&oldid=1160709993) (ECC) amplían este concepto con el "
"intercambio de claves [Diffie-Hellman de curva "
"elíptica](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Elliptic-"
"curve_Diffie%E2%80%93Hellman&oldid=1160050860) (ECDH). ECDH funciona de "
"manera similar a DH pero aprovecha las propiedades de las curvas elípticas, "
"lo que resulta en un sistema más seguro y eficiente.\n"

